Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 06:48:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] sdl1: ten save slots per game, each game in its own
 folder

Slots go to <save folder>/<game>/SaveStateN.aws|bmp, the game being the
image the machine boots from (hard drive 1 when one is in, else floppy
drive 1), taken at start-up and at each reboot so changing disks inside
a game keeps its folder. The slot picker's title names the game; the F1
help lists F10 and F11 on lines of their own.
